# JavaScript

- This app uses `jsbundling-rails` + esbuild + Yarn (see `package.json` and builds under `app/assets/builds`).
- Stimulus controllers live under `app/javascript/controllers/`. Keep controllers thin, data-attribute-driven, and page-scoped.
- Use Turbo for navigation and streams.
- ESLint: follow project rules when editing JS (`yarn lint`).
- No inline JavaScript in ERB for behavior — use Stimulus actions or dedicated bundles.
